== Foundation

The Foundation phase establishes the prerequisites for secure development. Complete these tasks before or in parallel with early development work — they ensure your team has the right people and the knowledge to make security decisions throughout the project.

.*What this phase covers*
[%collapsible]
====
[mermaid]
----
flowchart LR
    R[Assign people to security-related project roles] --> C[Ensure competence]
----

* *Assign people to security-related project roles* — Make security responsibilities explicit by assigning accountable people to key roles.
* *Ensure competence* — Verify that team members have adequate cybersecurity knowledge for their roles, and arrange training where needed.
====
=== Why it matters

Without assigned roles, tasks fall through the cracks. Without competence, even good processes produce weak results. Foundation addresses both.

